# Databases. db/haven.db and db/haven.pre-sim.db are committed on purpose (the
# test suite seeds itself from them); already-tracked files ignore these rules.
# Everything else — platform.db, per-company databases, journals — stays local.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
